    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.0, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 2, lineHeight: 1.22 }}>接力/分发/汇总/往返/共享；ZCode→OpenCode→Hermes 实证</Text>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 7, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, height: 352 }}>
