    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.4, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 2 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#073E87' }}>① 规则驱动</span>：按任务板依赖图自动解封与流转</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.4, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 2 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#073E87' }}>② 智能体驱动</span>：由主管或异构验收智能体裁决 PASS/FAIL</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.4, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 2 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#9D0A12' }}>③ 混合 + 人兜底</span>：遇轮内审批或超预算熔断暂停，交人裁决</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1.08, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #CBD5E1', borderRadius: 5, padding: '4px 6px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.4, color: '#073E87', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>3. 传决定 2 路与接力实测</Text>
    <Box style={{ background: '#FEE2E2', border: '1px solid #FCA5A5', borderRadius: 4, padding: '1px 5px', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.8, color: '#9D0A12', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>怎么传</Text>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.3, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 2 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#073E87' }}>甲路(信息尾块)</span> 全宿主通 ｜ <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#9D0A12' }}>乙路(MCP/网关)</span> 调工具派活</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.3, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 2 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#073E87' }}>跨产品实测</span>：ZCode 算平方 → OpenCode 算总和得 55</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.3, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 2 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#047857' }}>异构独立验收</span>：中心自动派 Hermes 复算返回 PASS</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #CBD5E1', borderRadius: 5, padding: '4px 6px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.4, color: '#073E87', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>4. 交接包四件套与单写者锁</Text>
    <Box style={{ background: '#ECFDF5', border: '1px solid #6EE7B7', borderRadius: 4, padding: '1px 5px', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.8, color: '#047857', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>防漂移</Text>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 2, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 3 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #CBD5E1', borderRadius: 3, padding: '2px 4px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.1, color: '#1F2937' }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#073E87' }}>① 要求标准</span> · CLAUDE.md</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #CBD5E1', borderRadius: 3, padding: '2px 4px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.1, color: '#1F2937' }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#073E87' }}>② 角色任务</span> · TASK.md</Text>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 2, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 3 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #CBD5E1', borderRadius: 3, padding: '2px 4px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.1, color: '#1F2937' }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#073E87' }}>③ 记忆文件</span> · 路径指针</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #CBD5E1', borderRadius: 3, padding: '2px 4px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.1, color: '#1F2937' }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#073E87' }}>④ 上手步骤</span> · 先读哪几个</Text>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.2, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 2 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#9D0A12' }}>四态回执 + 单写者锁</span>：发出→送达→读到→交回，杜绝覆盖</Text>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #CBD5E1', borderRadius: 5, padding: '4px 6px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.4, color: '#073E87', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>5. 编排层「写下它 ↔ 看着它」回路：四类拓扑连线 × 三态轨迹对照 × 双颗粒度 Trace 叠层</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.5, color: '#9D0A12', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>粗粒度决策段 (turn+steps) ↔ 细粒度调用步</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 3, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 5 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 4, padding: '3px 6px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.5, color: '#073E87', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>四类拓扑连线 (节点=角色/文件/渠道)：</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.2, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 2 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#073E87' }}>任务线</span> 派发/转交 ｜ <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#047857' }}>信息线</span> 读写产出</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.2, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 1 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#6D28D9' }}>汇报线</span> 验收/介入 ｜ <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B45309' }}>唤醒线</span> 恢复与换模配额</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1.15, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 4, padding: '3px 6px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.5, color: '#073E87', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>三态轨迹对照 (预期规范 vs 真实轨迹)：</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.2, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 2 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#073E87' }}>━━ 实线(已实现)</span>：契约写了，实际也按约发生</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.2, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 1 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#6B7280' }}>┈┈ 虚线(未发生)</span>：未跑到 ｜ <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D97706' }}>━━ 橙色(越权)</span>：私调或越界</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1.1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 4, padding: '3px 6px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.5, color: '#073E87', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>双颗粒度 Trace 叠层 (annotate.js)：</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.2, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 2 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#9D0A12' }}>粗粒度决策段</span>：触发/备选/选择/理由 (挂 turn+steps)</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 8.2, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 1 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#073E87' }}>细粒度证据层</span>：展开 9 家会话库每一步推理与工具调用</Text>
